    {
      "type": "note",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 20,
      "text": "Don't stop at the balloons. The balloons are for the door, and the door is for nobody. Go left fast, jump late, don't look at the confetti. — Subject #67. ...That's my number. This is not my handwriting."
    },
    {
      "type": "npc",
      "x": 7,
      "y": 8,
      "requiresHelped": [
        "marla"
      ],
      "name": "XxMARLAxX",
      "npcId": "marla",
      "avatar": "blocky",
      "color": "#7fb069",
      "dialogAsk": "I checked this door for hinges. It has NOTHING. It's a door-shaped lie. ...Get out anyway. And when you find the real one? Dibs."
    },
    {
      "type": "npc",
      "x": 9,
      "y": 8,
      "requiresHelped": [
        "toby"
      ],
      "name": "TOBY.EXE",
      "npcId": "toby",
      "avatar": "scribble",
      "color": "#ff8a5c",
      "dialogAsk": "I drew you on the wall!! It's you going FAST. That's the plan, right? Go so fast the walls forget to be walls!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "npc",
      "x": 11,
      "y": 8,
      "requiresHelped": [
        "priya"
      ],
      "name": "PATCHNURSE",
      "npcId": "priya",
      "avatar": "plush",
      "color": "#e8a2b4",
      "dialogAsk": "One more sticker. This one says YOU ARE REAL. I made it myself, so it's true. Now go, sweetpea — quick, before I start leaking stuffing."
    },
    {
      "type": "npc",
      "x": 13,
      "y": 8,
      "requiresHelped": [
        "marcus"
      ],
      "name": "MVP_MARCUS",
      "npcId": "marcus",
      "avatar": "trophy",
      "color": "#ffd166",
      "dialogAsk": "Listen up, rookie. Nobody has ever beaten the next room. So beat it. First place is just somebody finally doing the thing. Go be somebody."
    },
    {
      "type": "npc",
      "x": 15,
      "y": 8,
